nsures repeated cancels don't fail\n- `cancel_fails_409_when_shipment_confirmed_and_changes_nothing`: Validates blocking behavior when CONFIRMED shipment exists, no state changes\n- `cancel_fails_404_for_unknown_order`: Ensures proper 404 response with error envelope\n- `newly_created_order_has_active_status`: Verifies orders start in ACTIVE status\n- `create_shipment_fails_409_when_order_cancelled`: Prevents shipment creation for cancelled orders\n\nVerification: Ran `./mvnw test` from sample-service/ directory. Result: BUILD SUCCESS with 19 tests passed (9 in OrderControllerTest, 6 in ShipmentControllerTest, 3 in CustomerControllerTest, 1 in SampleServiceApplicationTests).\n\nNot done: Nothing — all ticket requirements implemented, tested, and verified."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":259,"cache_read_input_tokens":38910,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":259},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7b4d64d8-c1fe-478a-a134-a19719902463","uuid":"65cb7133-8e8a-4866-a27a-bda639e5a6fc","timestamp":"2026-09-09T10:26:37.956Z","request_id":"req_011CeshraHMCmkAWfyTqqHS5"}
